WEBVTT

00:14:56.130 --> 00:15:02.776
It's more about, we can protect people
from environmental toxins.

00:15:02.800 --> 00:15:05.246
We talk a lot about data. (Laughs)

00:15:05.270 --> 00:15:06.699
AG: You seem so sociable.

00:15:06.723 --> 00:15:08.286
(Luz laughs)

00:15:08.310 --> 00:15:10.657
AG: I would have thought
you like people too much

00:15:10.681 --> 00:15:13.756
to do this kind of isolated,
solitary work.

00:15:13.780 --> 00:15:16.046
LC: Well, it is lonely work in a way,

00:15:16.070 --> 00:15:20.046
but also, because I am Puerto Rican,

00:15:20.070 --> 00:15:23.488
and as you grow in this field,

00:15:23.512 --> 00:15:25.359
because there's so few ...

00:15:26.414 --> 00:15:28.946
people of color in science,

00:15:28.970 --> 00:15:31.728
the higher you go up the academic ladder,